  restoring atom style atomic from restart
  triclinic box = (0.17231178 0.16668352 0.17307886) to (35.797688 35.803316 35.796921) with tilt (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
